        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "4 years ago",
        "text": "Both personable & professional. Great value for your dollar. Knowledgeable & understanding of any / all potential needs.\nI've been coming to this establishment for a number of years & I will keep coming back given that they are friendly & caring; they take the time required to make you feel special as a client. I've always felt satisfied & happy with (treatment) results ! Highly recommended !",
        "time": 1636575383,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Jessica Colatosti",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/118284247825469810220/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJoiY4z360CfAZQWt-qo9qz13Lrmv_LETmtljsA9j519Sjn-A=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "3 years ago",
        "text": "I've been a client of Fil's for 10 years now, and I will be a client for life! I've had laser and Oxygeneo facials done over the years and I couldn't be happier with the results. NovaCorps is a clean and professional environment, and the new location is super accessible. I highly recommend NovaCorps to anyone looking for professional treatments by a friendly and highly trained staff.",
        "time": 1673444220,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Katherine Bidnyk",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/112580324331872493033/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLMllSuX4CyCwnTiVnEXdEnIieAHybpS5eY8AqsmarNQ7lpMA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "5 years ago",
        "text": "Amazing service.  Filomena is kind and attentive. The oxygeneo facial is the most awesome treatment I've invested in!  This super facial treatment is exceptional!! I had my first one in June 2019 and it is now part of my skin regiment every season.  I had an IPL treatment in February for dark spots and couperose and I'm amazed with the results after one treatment.  I really look forward for my 2nd treatment as soon as they re-open. Thank you Filomena for embellishing my skin!",
        "time": 1587653090,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Priscila Gula",
